  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous and differentiable for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
