    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous but not differentiable for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
