  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is continuous and differentiable <math><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>"
  }
